Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:18:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 23/35] bitproxy: live upload/download per app on the dashboard

The Apps card shows each app's current speed next to its name, summed
per uid from sing-box connection events (listed apps always carry their
uid because their rules match on user_id). The connection subscription
only runs while the card is expanded and the VPN is on.
